        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nEntrance porch – (1.5m x 1.6m), Tile flooring\r\nHallway – (7.3m x 2.4m), Carpet flooring\r\nLiving Room – (5.1m x 4.4m), Carpet flooring, open fireplace, bay window\r\nDining Room – (4.9m x 3.5m), Carpet flooring, sliding door to rear\r\nKitchen – (6.3m x 3.4m), Lino flooring, cabinets at waist and eye level, plumbed for washing machine\r\nInner hallway – (2.4m x 2.4m), Lino flooring\r\nWC – (2.3m x .95m), Lino flooring, WC, WHB\r\nConservatory – (4.2m x 2.3m), Tile flooring\r\nInner hallway 6m x .9m Carpet flooring\r\n\r\n1st Floor\r\nBedroom No. 1 – (1 3.2m x 2.4m), Carpet flooring\r\nShower Room – (3.3m x 2.4m), Carpet flooring, HP, shower\r\nBathroom – (3.4m x 2.8m), Carpet flooring, WC, WHB, bidet, bathtub\r\n\r\n1st Floor return\r\nBedroom No. 2 (4.6m x 3.5m), Carpet flooring\r\nEn Suite – (2.5m x 1.2m), Carpet flooring, WC, WHB, electric shower\r\nBedroom No. 3 – (6.1m x 4.9m), Carpet flooring, bay window\r\nEn Suite – (1.9m x 1.4m), Carpet flooring, WC, WHB, shower\r\n\r\n2nd Floor\r\nBedroom No. 4 – (3.5m x 3.3m), Carpet flooring, sea views\r\nEn Suite – (2.4m x 1.2m), Carpet flooring WC, WHB, shower\r\nBedroom No. 5 – (3.8m x 3m), Carpet flooring\r\nBedroom 6 2.9m x 2.5m Carpet flooring\r\n\r\nOutbuildings\r\nBoiler shed – (1.8m x 1m)\r\nPotting station – (2.7m x 1.7m)\r\nGarden shed\r\n\r\nOutside: Gated garden to front, landscaped back garden, water feature,\r\nServices: Mains water & sewerage, Oil fired central heating & electric heating, ESB\r\nBER: Exempt\r\nApply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072\r\nViewing: Strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent."
